      description: "Final step. Requires the request status to be `pending_general_manager`, otherwise\nfails with `422` (\"subscription request must be pending general manager\").\n\nInside one database transaction it:\n  1. Marks the request as `subscription_approved`\n  2. Creates a new plot dossier with status `allocatable`\n  3. Creates/updates the partners' investors and attaches them to the dossier\n  4. Creates the facility linked to the dossier + its authorized persons\n  5. Syncs daily consumption and production capacities, logs dossier partners, creates folders\n  6. Updates the plot status to `subscribed`\n\n**Notifications fired:**\nDomain events `InvestorCreated` / `InvestorUpdated` for new/updated partners.\nNo user notification is currently fired.\n"
